# Build log & process

- `docs/CHAT/BUILD_LOG.md` is **append-only**. Never edit or delete past entries; correct with a
  new entry.
- Every significant user-requested change gets: date · agent · phase · verbatim/summarised request ·
  what changed · response/summary · commit/ADR links.
- Substantial design chats → excerpt in `docs/CHAT/sessions/<date>-<slug>.md`, linked from the log.
- Commits: Conventional Commits (`type(scope): subject`). Every meaningful step is its own commit.
- PRs must pass CI, name the roadmap phase, confirm the 8 laws, link BUILD_LOG/ADR. Never commit
  secrets.
